-- ccc20-tests-reverse-onus.l4 -- tests for ccc20-part16-reverse-onus.l4 (s 515(4.1) to (4.4), (6), (6.1), (7), (10)). Expected values are hand-written from the text of lines 11408-11491.

§ `Tests -- section 515(4.1): the listed offences`
