-- (4.2) args: an order is to be made under (2); the answer of (4.3); the condition; the Attorney General makes the request for an electronic monitoring device
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(a) that the accused abstain from communicating, directly or indirectly, with any victim, witness or other person identified in the order` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(a.1) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(a.2) that the accused wear an electronic monitoring device` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(a.2) that the accused wear an electronic monitoring device` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(b) that the accused comply with any other condition specified in the order that the justice considers necessary to ensure the safety and security of those persons` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` FALSE (JUST TRUE) `s 515(4.2)(a) that the accused abstain from communicating, directly or indirectly, with any victim, witness or other person identified in the order` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE (JUST FALSE) `s 515(4.2)(a) that the accused abstain from communicating, directly or indirectly, with any victim, witness or other person identified in the order` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.2) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE NOTHING `s 515(4.2)(a) that the accused abstain from communicating, directly or indirectly, with any victim, witness or other person identified in the order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4.4) args: an order is to be made under (2); under the Code; the Code provision; the condition
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(1)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(3)") `s 515(4.4)(b) that the accused abstain from having in their possession any instrument specified in the order that is suitable for the purpose of breaking into any place or motor vehicle` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(4)") `s 515(4.4)(c) that the accused return to and remain at their place of residence at the times specified in the order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(2)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 348, "(1)(d)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 348, "(1)(a)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` TRUE FALSE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(1)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 515(4.4) the justice must consider whether it is desirable to include the condition` FALSE TRUE (`Provision of the Code` OF 333.1, "(1)") `s 515(4.4)(a) that the accused abstain from going to any place or entering any geographic area specified in the order` EQUALS JUST FALSE

